{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rPWqABhXAJrS-pMbHYzy1Q","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:17.359331+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rPWqABhXAJrS-pMbHYzy1Q","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Y2p3eQxeNicgBd8O2htibaHibdTyKibOQ8zDAvxeRiazPIkU92MJLALvKgwvAXBLh5oIPYRIofZJE9A8vp0uJMicy9a4JmAo8RcX2HK4hXJM6icmkc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;watermark=1#imgIndex=0\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/S0vOcN1JfC1S5t66NreGrXYhZWjm9kicVccJ2QkftrHa5iaoicdlajIAEVOgXOVzt3GOFcytxSQullibLzaEpRg61GibdGWIqJE4yuvO6oDC79Cs/640?wx_fmt=png#imgIndex=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>生物制造是新一轮科技革命和产业变革的关键领域，已作为战略性新兴产业纳入国家中长期发展规划。复旦大学生物技术学院充分利用学校在理、工、医、商等多学科领域的综合优势，创设</span><span><strong><span>多学科交叉融合</span></strong></span><span>育人生态，以</span><strong><span><span>“三基地一平台”</span></span></strong><span>（校内基地-校外基地-境外基地-</span><span>产业化平台</span><span>）协同联动为组织模式，聚焦国家战略需求和产业变革需要，以</span><strong><span><span>“产业需求导向、前沿技术探索、项目驱动学习、全程跨界融合”</span></span></strong><span>为核心理念，以项目实战为抓手，构建</span><span><strong><span>沉浸式项目制</span></strong></span><span>培养体系，打造</span><strong><span><span>“学、研、产”全链深度协同</span></span></strong><span>育人范式，培养具备从基础研究、技术研发到产品实现全链条创新能力的复合型实战人才，一体化打造国家级拔尖创新人才自主培养试验区、国际领先的生命制造原始创新策源地和未来生物产业变革孵化地。</span></p><p><span>复旦大学生物技术学院独立招生（校内院系代码204），招收具有生物学、药学、基础医学、化学、生物医学工程、环境科学与工程、公共卫生与预防医学、材料科学与工程、复杂系统科学与工程等学科背景的优秀学生攻读博士学位。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/S0vOcN1JfC14LpKlHlXCPBobyhibnrc0Ltr4X1W1tgGv3FXicOb92jnoalNA3UCuomicgl6URBskYjkyxKbFV7aEAXQXBn9fPjyDpQfiatzibic5I/640?wx_fmt=png#imgIndex=2\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>即日起至8月15日17:00</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>二、报名条件</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.全国各高等学校2027年应届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><span>2.学业成绩优秀，预期可获得推免生推荐资格。</span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span>有志于从事生物制造相关的科学研究与产业转化工作，具备一定的学术科研能力或潜力，在产品开发及成果落地方面具有较强的创新意识与实践能力。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>三、报名材料</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1.近期正面免冠彩色证件照片，电子版JPG格式，150×200像素，大小500K以内。</span></p><p><span>2.本科阶段现有完整成绩单（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章），JPG或PDF格式。</span></p><p><span>3.外语水平证明，如CET-4、CET-6、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等。</span></p><p><span>4.有关获奖证书和学术科研成果，如发表论文、出版物或其他原创性工作。</span></p><p><span>5.诚信承诺书（可从报考服务系统下载，签名后上传）。</span></p><p><span>6.两封由正高职称专家签字出具的推荐信（在报考服务系统中在线填写相关信息，通过邮件上传，</span><span><strong><span>无须</span></strong></span><span>下载打印，</span><strong><span><span>无须</span></span></strong><span>寄送纸质件），推荐人应与报考学科有关，且不能是意向报考导师。</span></p><p><span>7.个人自述。包括个人简历、本科期间学习、科研、实践工作简介，对读研期间学习和未来职业规划的初步设想。1000字左右。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>四、报名方式</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>申请人登录复旦大学研究生招生网https://gsao.fudan.edu.cn，通过“研究生报考服务系统”中的“推免生报名”进行网上报名。本单位</span><span><strong><span>无须</span></strong></span><span>寄送纸质材料。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>五、考核时间及方式</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>考核时间：暂定9月上旬（将以邮件形式通知复试考生）。</span></p><p><span>考核地点：线下考核，复试考核具体安排将另行通知。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、相关说明</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1.申请人应承诺填报信息和提交材料的真实性。如有弄虚作假，一经发现将取消申请资格并通报其本科院校。</span></p><p><span>2. 申请人在录取当年入学报到前必须取得国家承认的本科毕业证书和学位证书，否则录取资格无效。</span></p><p><span>3. 凡有意报考我单位2027级直博生的同学（含本校本科生），应申请参加本次报名。如果上级部门和学校关于直博生招生有新要求，我单位将按新要求执行并及时通知申请人。</span></p><p><span>4.咨询方式：</span></p><p><span>gsyjw@fudan.edu.cn。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>END</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>复旦大学生物技术学院</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>欢迎关注</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Y2p3eQxeNicia7CibjAGs6TMBn4QAzEDX8RmxibM7jI4o3uqm0TyiasFbIKwibtjhicHYhuRzrwr8JlDLLsllHKeRjTTkXo5MBmEOkwpSmZh16c0ZE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;watermark=1#imgIndex=3\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"b31bbdb8aec36035f342c5761b6233010f9449dc9d45c4c709796bef20f8735b","textLength":1254,"sourceSha256":"ede4ac18d943b6e8a7cd8fab3a082e9135e5b5bcc70c19c0686b12f6d69922c1","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-90cd755a43b583a11380","title":"2026年复旦大学生物技术学院2027级直博生招生报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:17.359331+00:00"}
